1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,401
Now you are in the valley, at real scale.

2
00:00:03,351 --> 00:00:10,186
The river is one hundred meters wide and the factory is five hundred meters upstream, on the other bank.

3
00:00:10,186 --> 00:00:17,726
The orange line along the bank is the stretch of cable over land, and the dashed line crosses the water to the factory.

4
00:00:17,726 --> 00:00:22,074
The orange post marks the point where the cable leaves the bank.

5
00:00:22,074 --> 00:00:28,377
Move it with the slider or with the graph, and see how the length and the cost of each stretch change.

6
00:00:28,377 --> 00:00:36,156
With the headset, the left joystick takes you quickly through the valley, and the right one lets you rise to look at it from above.

7
00:00:36,156 --> 00:00:39,428
With Back to the model you return to the table.

